{"ID":"20240118145013-40bve3y","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145013-40bve3y","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145013-40bve3y\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145013-589gpkd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240204144859-i1gmh5l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240204144859-i1gmh5l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"321桐叶","type":"doc","updated":"20240204144859"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145013-589gpkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145013-589gpkd","updated":"20240122161850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，寒，无毒。治恶蚀疮着阴。皮，治五痔，杀三虫，花，主敷猪疮，饲猪，肥大三倍。生山谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161853-h19a5od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161853-h19a5od"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产山区。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161855-bm0u3mb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161855-bm0u3mb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】桐叶及桐木皮俱味苦，性寒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161854-9hrghpl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161854-9hrghpl"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】桐叶及皮皆消肿毒，生毛发，杀三虫。桐花能明目。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161857-8ao9q4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161857-8ao9q4y"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】桐木皮疗奔豚气病。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161858-6dyoo6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161858-6dyoo6w"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】桐木皮治五淋，沐发去头风，生发滋润。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161900-zpywyik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161900-zpywyik"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【时珍】桐叶消肿毒，生发，桐木皮治恶出疮，小儿丹毒，煎汁涂之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161902-5vvv419","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161902-5vvv419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般三钱至五钱。【禁忌】无。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161903-r1i8n8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161903-r1i8n8r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【附方】手足浮肿——桐叶煎汁渍之，并饮少许，加小豆良。肘后方：削桐木煮汁洗，并饮少许。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161909-6d0ss5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161909-6d0ss5t"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"（圣惠方）发落不生——桐叶一把，麻子仁三升，米泔煮汤去渣，日日洗之。（肘后）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161913-c5urjqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161913-c5urjqc"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"眼见诸物——禽虫飞走，乃肝胆之疾，青桐（紫花者）花，酸枣仁，元明粉，羌活各一两为末，每服二钱，水煎和渣服，日三。（经验方）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122161915-n84ue2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161915-n84ue2n"}},{"ID":"20240122161916-f5vcvdo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122161916-f5vcvdo","updated":"20240204144857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看，321页，桐叶，这个桐叶就是桐树的叶子，很多，到处都有。主要的，我们使用桐叶的地方，一样，皮肤消肿，长毛发，桐花能够明目，一般来说，甄权,我们制那个，用桐叶来治五淋呐，生发，滋润，生发滋润我们一般不用桐叶，用柏叶，柏叶比桐叶还好，柏叶长得细细的，就像头发，长头发。那桐叶一般就是外用，这个小孩，你看桐叶治皮肤的恶疮呐都可以使用。附方，诸位可以参考一下，附方，我们在经验方上面来说的话，我就把它挑出来看，《圣惠方》手脚浮肿，用桐叶来，还有头发掉下来，没办法再生回去，我们桐叶，出至《肘后方》，我把它集中在一起，让诸位比较好读，好研读这个桐叶。"}]},{"ID":"20240204144859-i1gmh5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240204144859-i1gmh5l"}}]}